        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-21T18:24:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've used Bunkar and Fanatic against Blade (this is the original release, not Enhanced, so H=4) in Megalopolis, and won.</p><p>More recently, I've been experimenting with the idea of a two-<em>villain</em> game, where both villains are at half HP, and H is reduced by one. &nbsp;This would be a cakewalk for someone like Tempest, but could be pretty intense otherwise, I think.</p>",
